<h1>adaptiveError
</h1>

<h2><a name="_name"></a>PURPOSE <a href="#_top"><img alt="^" border="0" src="../../up.png"></a></h2>
<div class="box"><strong>adaptive error when running Getty, so to reflect time that</strong></div>

<h2><a name="_synopsis"></a>SYNOPSIS <a href="#_top"><img alt="^" border="0" src="../../up.png"></a></h2>
<div class="box"><strong>function adaptiveError(display) </strong></div>

<h2><a name="_description"></a>DESCRIPTION <a href="#_top"><img alt="^" border="0" src="../../up.png"></a></h2>
<div class="fragment"><pre class="comment"> adaptive error when running Getty, so to reflect time that
 Getty won't release control

 can be called in MoJuSit_(prj) to modify 'on the fly' the error timer</pre></div>

<!-- crossreference -->
<h2><a name="_cross"></a>CROSS-REFERENCE INFORMATION <a href="#_top"><img alt="^" border="0" src="../../up.png"></a></h2>
